graph TD
    User((Student/Lecturer/Admin)) -->|HTTPS/JWT| Nginx[Nginx Reverse Proxy<br/>UI at / · API at /api/v1]
    Nginx -->|Static Files| Frontend[Vue 3 Frontend]
    Nginx -->|API Requests| Backend[Go Gin Backend]

    subgraph Auth & RBAC
        Backend --> AuthService[Auth Service<br/>JWT + token_version]
        AuthService --> JWT[Token version check<br/>password change evicts sessions]
        AuthService --> RBAC[RoleMiddleware<br/>Admin / Lecturer / Student]
        Backend --> PublicID[publicid codec<br/>Sqids over ID_SALT<br/>opaque ids on the wire]
    end

    subgraph Controllers
        Backend --> QuizCtrl[Quiz Controller<br/>submit · preview · SSE stream]
        Backend --> LecturerCtrl[Lecturer Controller<br/>exams · questions · roster · import]
        Backend --> PracticeCtrl[Practice Controller<br/>questions · categories · attempts]
        Backend --> ExamCatCtrl[Exam Category Controller]
        Backend --> UserCtrl[User Controller<br/>login · passwords · bulk reset]
        Backend --> ExportCtrl[Export Controller<br/>submission-log emailer]
    end

    subgraph Concurrency
        QuizCtrl -->|exam DML only| Queue[SubmissionQueue<br/>1 worker · cap 256 · 30s timeout]
        QuizCtrl -.->|SELECT: lock-free<br/>30s context.WithTimeout| Logic
        PracticeCtrl -.->|practice: no queue<br/>savepoint isolation only| Logic
        Logic -->|per-schema advisory lock<br/>shared on eval / exclusive on rebuild| RebuildLock[(pg_advisory_xact_lock)]
    end

    subgraph "Restricted execution pools — ARCH-022"
        Logic --> PoolRO[quiz_exec_ro<br/>-> exam_student_readonly]
        Logic --> PoolRW[quiz_exec_rw<br/>-> exam_student]
        Logic --> PoolPRO[quiz_exec_prev_ro<br/>-> exam_student_preview_readonly]
        Logic --> PoolPRW[quiz_exec_prev_rw<br/>-> exam_student_preview]
        Note[NOINHERIT · one membership each<br/>poolForRole never falls back to the app pool]
    end

    subgraph PostgreSQL
        Backend -->|privileged app pool| DB[(PostgreSQL 15+)]
        DB -->|app schema| AppDB[System Tables<br/>users · exams · categories · questions<br/>submissions · practice · password_events · export_state]
        DB -->|public schema| MainDB[Legacy global curriculum<br/>fallback when curriculum_schema = 'public']
        DB --> ExamCur[curriculum_exam_id<br/>per-exam reference DB]
        DB --> ExamCat[exam_cat_id<br/>per-exam-category reference DB]
        DB --> PracticeDB[practice_cat_id<br/>per-practice-category reference DB]
        DB -.->|cloned lazily, LIKE INCLUDING ALL<br/>+ INSERT SELECT| ExamSandbox[DML sandboxes<br/>sandbox_exam_id · sandbox_exam_cat_id]
        DB -.->|optional decoy, display only| Decoy[_preview schemas<br/>same structure, different data]
    end

    subgraph Evaluation Logic
        Backend --> Logic[Validation Engine]
        Queue -->|serialised exam DML| Logic
        Logic -->|smart-quote normalise · resolve target_table| Prep[Statement prep]
        Logic -->|SET LOCAL ROLE · search_path schema, public, pg_temp last| ExamSandbox
        Logic -->|apply seed_sql or auto_seed inside savepoint| ExamSandbox
        Logic -->|BEGIN; SAVEPOINT student_eval;<br/>… ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT; COMMIT| ExamSandbox
        Logic -->|SELECT under exam_student_readonly| ExamCur
        Logic -->|SELECT under exam_student_readonly| ExamCat
        Logic -->|practice SELECT + DML<br/>savepoint-rollback| PracticeDB
        Logic -.->|dual_schema preview only<br/>preview-only roles| Decoy
        Logic -->|cached expected_result comparison<br/>case-folded column names| AppDB
    end

    subgraph Out-of-band jobs
        ExportCtrl --> Exporter[SubmissionExportService<br/>interval loop · gzip CSV over SMTP]
        Exporter --> AppDB
        QuizCtrl --> SSE[SSE Hub<br/>exam-status frames · 20s keep-alive]
    end
